--TEST--
A second case of one name in one enum is `E0304` at the second case, and two cases of one value compile
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Size {
    Small = 1,
    Tiny = 1,
}

enum Suit {
    Hearts,
    Spades,
    Hearts = 5,
}

echo Size::Small as int, "\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0304]: the enum `Suit` declares the case `Hearts` twice
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
